    },
    "text": "This gap exists due to a lack of right understanding and living in animal consciousness\u2014focusing solely on physical facilities rather than prioritizing right understanding in the self and relationships with human beings alongside physical facilities.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
