    ]
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0007",
    "task_id": "task_0007",
    "strategy": "insert_below",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 48
      }
    },
    "text": "It is getting wider, because physical facilities are necessary but not adequate for human beings; without developing right understanding and fulfillment in relationships, accumulating physical facilities fails to resolve unhappiness.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 48
      }
    },
    "review_flags": [
      "shared_answer_space",
      "chain_insert"
    ]
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0008",
    "task_id": "task_0008",
    "strategy": "insert_below",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 54
      }
    },
    "text": "Unhappiness in the family is more due to a lack of fulfillment in relationships than a lack of physical facility, as physical facility alone is not adequate for human beings.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 54
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0009",
    "task_id": "task_0009",
    "strategy": "fill_existing",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 57
      }
    },
    "text": "A major portion of time and effort is invested in obtaining physical facilities, whereas relatively little time and effort are invested in ensuring fulfillment in relationships and right understanding.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 56
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0010",
    "task_id": "task_0010",
    "strategy": "insert_below",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 73
      }
    },
    "text": "1. The basic human aspiration is continuous happiness and prosperity.\n2. For an animal, physical facility is necessary and largely adequate; for a human being, physical facility is necessary but NOT adequate.\n3. In addition to physical facility (with nature), relationship (with human beings) and right understanding (in the self) are required.\n4. Living only for physical facility equals animal consciousness; living for all three with the right priority equals human consciousness.\n5. Holistic development is the transformation from animal consciousness to human consciousness, enabled by education\u2013sanskar.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 73
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
