      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 123
      }
    },
    "text": "Based on the discussion, the role in the education system is to facilitate holistic development by enabling education\u2013sanskar. This involves helping individuals undergo the transformation from animal consciousness to human consciousness by developing right understanding in the self, fulfilling relationships with human beings, and ensuring physical facility with nature in the correct priority.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 122
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0015",
    "task_id": "task_0015",
    "strategy": "fill_existing",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 128
      }
    },
    "text": "For an animal, physical facility is both necessary and largely adequate; once an animal's physical needs are satisfied, it is at peace. For a human being, physical facility is necessary but not adequate. In addition to physical facilities, human beings require right understanding in the self and harmonious relationships with other human beings. Living solely for physical facilities corresponds to animal consciousness, whereas living for right understanding, relationships, and physical facilities with the correct priority characterizes human consciousness.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 127
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0016",
    "task_id": "task_0016",
    "strategy": "fill_existing",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 133
      }
    },
    "text": "Holistic development is the transformation from animal consciousness, which focuses solely on physical facility, to human consciousness, which balances physical facility with relationship and right understanding in the correct priority. The role of education\u2011sanskar is to enable and guide this transformation by cultivating the right understanding and nurturing relationships alongside physical well-being.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 132
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0017",
    "task_id": "task_0017",
    "strategy": "fill_existing",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 138
      }
    },
    "text": "Living with animal consciousness means prioritizing only physical facility; the individual seeks basic sustenance and comfort. Living with human consciousness requires integrating three elements\u2014right understanding in the self, healthy relationships with others, and adequate physical facility\u2014arranged in the correct priority. The priority sequence is: first, right understanding; second, meaningful relationships; third, physical facility. This balanced approach elevates the individual from a purely animalistic state to a fully human, holistic consciousness.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 137
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
