      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 10
      }
    },
    "text": "Example: If the fill\u2011in blank were \"What motivates you to learn?\", a suitable answer might be: \"I am motivated by a desire to acquire knowledge that enables me to contribute positively to society and to continually grow as an individual.\", illustrating how a reflective answer can fill the blank effectively.",
